{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4618797181effde0a352b3e09c84e77479ee235f2a033a525d48b5b641da2b22",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8ad83f6f14ff0500887cebf408c5501f576e595c2cc53a486af2c57f6ba031",
      "text": "独一无二的生日会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414676055bb70528a531c4b97648cd83c24097badb1b14b77951cc6c7ad14d54",
      "text": "课程结束后，诚司将某个信封\n交给了英雄、龙以及制作人。\n那是天音筹备的诚司生日会的\n邀请函。上面还写着来自天音的\n可爱“请求”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65f0d45e3149d2d8b3e315bb7684814dee4d778946a6c61f117602b1ebb69a6f",
      "text": "今天要带去的，就是这个\n生日派对的装饰品，\n还有礼物，没错吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df4ffb257c257264be2c72377f97a742bc30ba2a73bf0fbfe31204b47f7c77cb",
      "text": "是的！全都装在这个袋子里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7e2cced377c6d5a924b46ef23108a9e024b55e835556fa02f556c609235274c",
      "text": "制作人好像\n还在忙工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc475b1d33980b75ba88688df53c090bccca6b3a66eeefc960ea5aa733605b54",
      "text": "离约好的时间还有富余，\n先确认一下有没有\n漏掉什么东西吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41763f5ad093e34cce9d8e7c05300f72a7503be0ed99e4901b93b8a850dccdad",
      "text": "好的！就这么办吧。\n说不定还会想起\n其他想要的东西呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d89e35ded7a5a59b5f1110929e1ed29c64796fc9817208b2b9981fc6564eb0",
      "text": "马上就是信玄的生日会了啊。\n从现在起就让人期待了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e63a82457ecdfc234e9a6c5e5a90ac6fb82e1be786c2860baadc13a106cb532",
      "text": "我也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d59d54d353de28803b3e7a9faaf88f2db0c436876e05d018740d6d6d4f9c27d",
      "text": "天音非常有干劲。\n听说她每天都在琢磨\n要做什么样的蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40723a23a354b102c1b32371d350b11c306671c00dbb614c5dc1dbd4a6b8e836",
      "text": "听你这么一说，\n我就越来越期待了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:275c93535712f652e9846ecae5baec6b036dc1a2143420a123a6ad8a3eec5903",
      "text": "记得替我跟天音酱\n问个好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a2f9bf6a345ee3b9476ba5d6322a53639df68ac6a2493c770320b737637a0b5",
      "text": "天音听说龙君\n会来生日会，\n显得特别高兴呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:213260d241c9024399a82330a991d66c1da0028f1e56ddfcdf0c90ee4c2df172",
      "text": "那真是太好了！\n……等等，咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eafbb4d760014aa7c2480085b17c3a78b014ea68078c4f1ccd45d662574e9ed6",
      "text": "诚司先生，你的表情好吓人啊！\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27ffb72e3eda13b981d9370bb57c28eb9e0478dbc959356a28bcb942ea86b9da",
      "text": "抱歉，不知不觉脸上的表情就\n紧绷起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8791a3cbbb3d94a307810904bb2944da961f9130147aa278805f24b2da17dd0e",
      "text": "天音能高兴，\n我也很欣慰。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
